# > (greaterThanSign)

- _x > y_
- _x.>_

The binary form is `greater`:

```
>>> 1.pi > 1.e
true
```

The unary form is `ceiling`:

```
>>> 3.141.>
4
```

The name of this operator is `greaterThanSign`.

_Rationale_:
In J the ceiling operator is _>._,
in Apl it is _⌈_.

* * *

See also: >=, |>, <, <=, ceiling, Compare, greater

